  "system": {
    "content": "<h2>Getting started</h2><p>Drag onto this sheet an <strong>Origin</strong>, a <strong>Memory</strong>, an <strong>Attire</strong>, a <strong>Trick Weapon</strong> and a <strong>Firearm</strong> from the Items directory, then set Prowess, Resolve and Wit from your Memory.</p><p>Blood, Stamina and the Gear tracks count what you have left: lower them when you mark. Insight starts at 0 and counts up to 4.</p><ul><li><p>@UUID[JournalEntry.t3pSbCOssfwvNPwg.JournalEntryPage.qIyhoXP1Yog2Xa75]{Action Roll}</p></li><li><p>@UUID[JournalEntry.t3pSbCOssfwvNPwg.JournalEntryPage.oXrRoOTl85izY2xw]{Hunter's Information}</p></li><li><p>@UUID[JournalEntry.t3pSbCOssfwvNPwg.JournalEntryPage.z5bmn5BAu4OP0F0d]{Special Actions}</p></li><li><p>@UUID[Macro.OnJlC6a6vo9Bql9P]{Resist}: 1d per Stamina spent</p></li></ul>",
